# Screenshot/preview launch configs are per-machine. .claude/launch.json
# itself stays tracked (the project's own dev-server entry lives there),
# so a temporary entry added for a local preview must be removed before
# committing — one was accidentally shipped in 34e0250, pointing at a
# scratchpad path that exists on no other machine.
